From 56c6026383b7dd3dd7d99877f883ab13d76447c1 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Reyyzzz24 <revayuliansatria@gmail.com>
Date: Wed, 16 Sep 2026 17:03:10 +0700
Subject: [PATCH 25/25] feat(login): bundle Eprisi hero photo/logo defaults,
 show dynamic site name

HorizontalTemplate now falls back to the mockup's icon and background
photo (apps/meteor/public/images/eprisi/) whenever no admin has
uploaded a custom Layout logo/background asset, instead of a plain
navy panel. Matches mockups/rocketchat/login.jpg's layout.

Also renders the Site_Name setting next to the logo icon (was
logo-only before), so the wordmark reflects whatever the workspace is
actually named rather than requiring a raster logo with baked-in text.

Updates registration.page.poweredBy to "Eprisi Chat" for consistency
with the earlier sidebar footer rebrand (Powered_by_RocketChat).
